Noto fonts for PDF export
=========================

This directory ships SIL Open Font License (OFL 1.1) Noto fonts used to fill
PDF form fields that contain Arabic and/or Latin text. See OFL.txt.

Sources (hinted static Regular TTFs):
  https://github.com/notofonts/notofonts.github.io
  Noto Sans Regular (latin-greek-cyrillic)
  Noto Sans Arabic Regular (arabic)

Subset files (kept as the Latin fallback pair):
  NotoSans-Regular.ttf          ~18 KB   Basic Latin, Latin-1, punctuation
  NotoSansArabic-Regular.ttf    ~91 KB   Arabic + presentation forms

Runtime file (Noto Sans Arabic plus the Latin fallback, merged so pdf-lib
form appearances can reference a single Unicode font):
  NotoSansArabicLatin-Regular.ttf   ~106 KB

